.445">道</span><span begin="2:35.445" end="2:36.594">歉</span></p><p begin="2:36.754" end="2:40.337" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.754" end="2:37.268">我道</span><span begin="2:37.268" end="2:38.172">歉</span> <span begin="2:38.671" end="2:39.187">我道</span><span begin="2:39.187" end="2:40.337">歉</span></p><p begin="2:41.152" end="2:43.978" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.152" end="2:41.959">为我的</span><span begin="2:41.959" end="2:42.499">虚</span><span begin="2:42.499" end="2:42.746">荣</span><span begin="2:42.746" end="2:42.961">道</span><span begin="2:42.961" end="2:43.978">歉</span></p><p begin="2:44.254" end="2:48.495" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.254" end="2:44.768">我道</span><span begin="2:44.768" end="2:45.672">歉</span> <span begin="2:46.171" end="2:46.687">我道</span><span begin="2:46.687" end="2:48.495">歉</span></p><p begin="2:48.832" end="2:51.979" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.832" end="2:49.486">像每个</span><span begin="2:49.486" end="2:50.046">寓</span><span begin="2:50.046" end="2:50.533">言说</span><span begin="2:50.533" end="2:51.979">的</span></p><p begin="2:52.455" end="2:55.766" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.455" end="2:53.282">贪婪是</span><span begin="2:53.282" end="2:53.757">有</span><span begin="2:53.757" end="2:54.270">代价</span><span begin="2:54.270" end="2:55.766">的</span></p><p begin="2:56.381" end="3:02.827" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.381" end="2:57.035">我拥有</span><span begin="2:57.035" end="2:57.531">超</span><span begin="2:57.531" end="2:57.801">过</span><span begin="2:57.801" end="2:58.518">我能</span><span begin="2:58.518" end="2:59.502">承载的</span> <span begin="2:59.502" end="2:59.984">你连</span><span begin="2:59.984" end="3:00.936">结局</span><span begin="3:00.936" end="3:01.888">也不留</span><span begin="3:01.888" end="3:02.827">了</span></p></div><div begin="3:03.058" end="3:36.277" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:03.058" end="3:08.901" itu